"what":"Landstar System, Inc. (LSTR). This chart runs from Jan 15, 2026 to May 26, 2026.","setup":"The stock rose about 30% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 5 weeks, peaking at $166.11 and pulling back 14% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Apr 7, 2026 it closed at $166.84, its first close above the base high of $165.74. Volume that day was 514K shares, 1.31x the prior 10-day average of 391K. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $202.13, and the chart ends at $202.13.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that worked on light volume. The volume rule is a guide, not a law. It tilts the odds, and here the stock beat them."}}